Third-party content

The license above covers the configuration files and the documentation in this
repository — the JSON exports and this README.

The artwork the files point at is not the author's: posters, backdrops, tiles,
service logos, collection art and stream badges are gathered from the services
and projects they describe, and are included only as the assets this layout
needs. Those images, and the names and marks of everything referenced here
(Nuvio, Stremio, TMDB, TVDB, MDBList, MyAnimeList, AniList, OpenSubtitles,
TorBox, Real-Debrid and the rest), belong to their respective owners and are
not licensed by this file. Each addon's own license covers its code — this
repository only ships configuration for it.
